{
  "title": "重磅利好！信创统招采购时代即将来临",
  "description": "",
  "content": "<div class=\"newsxq\"> <div class=\"fhan\"> <div class=\"container\"> <p><a href=\"javascript:;\" onclick=\"javascript:history.back(-1);return false;\">返回<img src=\"../../../../static/home/images/tu14.png\" alt=\"\" /></a></p> </div> </div> <div class=\"xq_nr\"> <div class=\"container\"> <div class=\"xqnr\"> <div class=\"xq_l\"> <div class=\"xq_rq\"><span>24</span><font>2024.05</font></div> <div class=\"xq_l_l\"> <h2>重磅利好！信创统招采购时代即将来临</h2> <b>2024.05.24</b> <h1 class=\"rich_media_title \" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 14px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; font-weight: 400; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.4; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"><span style=\"font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">继2023年12月26日财政部会同工业和信息化部研究正式发布7项基础软硬件政府采购需求标准后，信创台式机、便携式采购又迎明确利好！</span></h1><h1 class=\"rich_media_title \" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 14px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; font-weight: 400; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.4; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"><span style=\"text-align: justify; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); line-height: 2em; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: text; max-width: 100%; max-inline-size: 100%; outline: none 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">2023年，12月2</span><span style=\"text-align: justify; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); line-height: 2em; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: text; max-width: 100%; max-inline-size: 100%; outline: none 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">6日，中国信息安全测评中心、国家保密科技测评中心联合发布了《安全可靠测评结果公告（2023年第1号）》，暨首批安全可靠测评清单。</span><br/></h1><h1 class=\"rich_media_title \" style=\"text-align: start; margin: 0px 0px 14px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; line-height: 1.4;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); line-height: 2em; color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: text; max-width: 100%; max-inline-size: 100%; outline: none 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">其中，万里安</span><span style=\"text-align: justify; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: text; line-height: 2em; max-width: 100%; max-inline-size: 100%; outline: none 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: text; max-width: 100%; max-inline-size: 100%; outline: none 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">全数据库软件V1.0成功入选</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: justify; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 1px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: text; max-width: 100%; max-inline-size: 100%; outline: none 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">，</span><span style=\"color: rgb(192, 0, 0); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: justify; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 1px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: text; max-width: 100%; max-inline-size: 100%; outline: none 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: none 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; cursor: text; font-size: 15px; line-height: 2em; max-width: 100%; max-inline-size: 100%;\">安全可靠等级测评为Ⅰ级。</strong></span></h1><h1 class=\"rich_media_title \" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 14px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; font-weight: 400; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.4; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"><strong style=\"color: rgb(192, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 1px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: justify; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); margin: 0px; padding: 0px; cursor: text; font-size: 15px; line-height: 2em; max-width: 100%; max-inline-size: 100%; outline: none 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); caret-color: red; line-height: 2.13em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span class=\"wx_text_underline\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 2px; outline: 0px; cursor: pointer; background: url(\">标志着万里数据库在</span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; caret-color: red; line-height: 2.13em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span class=\"wx_text_underline\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 2px; outline: 0px; cursor: pointer; background: url(\">自主知识产权、供应链安全、自主研发实力和产品能力</span></strong></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); caret-color: red; line-height: 2.13em; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span class=\"wx_text_underline\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 2px; outline: 0px; cursor: pointer; background: url(\">等方面能够满足各类用户对数据存储、管理、分析应用的严格要求。</span></span></strong></h1><p style=\"margin: 0px 15px; padding: 0px; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); cursor: text; color: rgb(208, 55, 57); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; caret-color: rgb(255, 0, 0); line-height: 2em; max-width: 100%; max-inline-size: 100%; outline: none 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; letter-spacing: 1px;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: none 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; cursor: text; color: rgb(192, 0, 0); max-width: 100%; max-inline-size: 100%;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: none 0px !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; cursor: text; font-size: 15px; line-height: 2em; max-width: 100%; max-inline-size: 100%;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: justify; text-wrap: wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); caret-color: red; line-height: 2.13em; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 1px; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span class=\"wx_text_underline\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 2px; outline: 0px; cursor: pointer; background: url(\"><img src=\"../../../../ueditor/php/upload/image/20240524/1716534787626378.png\" title=\"1716534787626378.png\" alt=\"640 (1).png\"/></span></span></strong></span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><section><br/></section><section>2024年3月11日，中央政府采购网发布<strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">《关于更新中央国家机关台式计算机、便携式计算机批量集中采购配置标准的通知》。</strong></section><section></section><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 16px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \">其中明确表示：<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">乡镇以上党政机关，以及乡镇以上党委和政府直属事业单位及部门所属为机关提供支持保障的事业单位在采购台式计算机、便携式计算机时，应当将CPU、操作系统符合安全可靠测评要求纳入采购需求。</strong></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><section><br/></section><section>此外，还提到，<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; text-decoration-line: underline; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">即日起，填报台式计算机、便携式计算机批量集中采购计划时，请严格遵守财库〔2023〕29号、30号文要求，根据实际需求在2024版配置包中合理选择相应配置。</span></section><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 16px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"><br/></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 16px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(144, 22, 10);\">意味着，<strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">即日起</strong><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">全国范围内从中央到省、市、区、县、乡使用财政拨款的国家机关，在采购台式计算机、便携式计算机时都要选择满足信创要求的机器。更意味着，</strong>党政信创区县下沉从趋势落到了实处，<strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \">从基础硬件-软件替换到电子公文系统以及电子政务系统国产化紧密衔接，未来发展空间较大。</strong>同时预示着<strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(66, 66, 66); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(144, 22, 10);\">信创统招采购模式未来将成为各地政府采购的新趋势，<strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(66, 66, 66); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(144, 22, 10);\">信创</span></strong></span></strong>产业向标准化、市场化<strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(66, 66, 66); box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(144, 22, 10);\">发展</span></strong>又迈进了一步。</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 16px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"><br/></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 16px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">那么，回到采购标准，何为满足信创要求呢？</strong></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 16px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 16px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">台式计算机、便携式计算机批量集中采购配置标准</span>2024版中给出了明确指标。首先，<strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">在预算上，</strong>台式机要求上限为5000元、<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">便携式</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">上限为</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">7000元；</span><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">在</span>CPU品牌限制上</strong>，台式机为龙芯、飞腾、<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">兆芯、</span>华为鲲鹏、申威、海光；便携式<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">为</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">龙芯≥3A5000、飞腾≥D2000、</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">兆芯≥KX-6640MA、</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">华为鲲鹏≥麒麟9006C、申威≥申威SW421（均为<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">入围第一批</span>安全可靠测评结果的CPU型</span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">号，均为I级。业内人士表示，I级为最低等级，接下来新款产品会以更高等级出现。</span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">）；<strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">在操作系统上，</strong></span></span>台式机和便携式均要求预装麒麟/统信UOS/中科方德/其他符合安全可靠测评要求的操作系统。此外，非信创配置如<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">Intel/AMD，</span>采购单位在选择此类<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">品牌时</span>应符合相关管理要求。其他如CPU物理核数、主频、内存、硬盘、显卡、USB接口等具体要求详见附件1、2。<strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"></strong></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 12px;\"></span></section><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><blockquote class=\"js_blockquote_wrap\" style=\"margin: 1em 0px; padding: 4px 0px 0px 10px; outline: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(219, 219, 219); color: var(--weui-FG-1); font-size: 15px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><section><section><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 12px;\">注：<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5MzA0MDUyMg==&mid=2247545907&idx=1&sn=28f36ef09d32f0695dd0553e3df4fe57&chksm=a69f65d691e8ecc00eddf354e4575326397d310f7d0b336e235e1b439a865de210e4a9b645ad&scene=21#wechat_redirect\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; text-decoration-line: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); -webkit-user-drag: none; cursor: pointer; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">《安全可靠测评结果公告（2023年第1号）》</a>，自发布之日起有效期三年。</span></section><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">CPU：</strong></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 12px;\">鲲鹏、龙芯、申威、飞腾、海思、麒麟、海光、兆芯18款通过测评。</span></section><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">操作系统：</strong></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 12px;\">麒麟、统信、中科方德三家企业6款操作系统通过测评。</span></section><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">数据库：</strong></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-size: 12px;\">达梦、阿里云、腾讯云、瀚高、虚谷伟业、南大通用、东方金信、人大金仓、海量数据、万里开源、优炫11款集中式数据库通过测评。</span></section></section></section></blockquote><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(144, 22, 10);\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">而<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">台式机、便携式</span>相关配置的明确，意味着政府招投标效率将进一步提升，信创招标采购也将更公正、科学、合理、透明，<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \">为行业信创标准的制定工作提供借鉴。</span></strong></span></section><section><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; color: rgb(144, 22, 10);\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"><br/></span></strong></span></section><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 16px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">区县乡信创PC采购政策明确后，出货量及市场空间有多大？</strong></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 16px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"><br/></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 16px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \">根据赛迪数据显示，2020-2022年信创PC出货量为200/300/235万台，其中党政出货190/280/200万台、行业出货10/20/35万台。可见，党政信创PC出货量仍然占比很大。叠加<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">区县乡级</span>政府采购需求，预计2024年<span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">信创</span>PC出货量约477万台，2027年有望达到1093万台。2027年PC存量约6747万台；2024年信创PC市场规模约238.51亿元，2027年有望达到546.52亿元。</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 16px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><section><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(144, 22, 10); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"></strong></span></strong></section><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 16px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \">展望2024，下一阶段信创产业的确定性向上，范围从省级以上政府变为区县乡政府+行业，规模从2280万台变为6000万台以上，建设时间节点定为2027年。</p><p><br/></p> </div> </div> <div class=\"xq_r\"> <dl> <a href=\"874.html\"> <dt><span>05</span><font>2025.12</font></dt> <dd> <h2>展会 | GreatSQL精彩亮相GOTC 2025 共建开源数据库生态新未来</h2> <font>2025.12.05</font> <p></p> </dd> </a> </dl> <dl> <a href=\"873.html\"> <dt><span>05</span><font>2025.12</font></dt> <dd> <h2>解决方案 | 200+系统信创改造！万里数据库助力中信银行信用卡中心实现高效平滑迁移</h2> <font>2025.12.05</font> <p></p> </dd> </a> </dl> <dl> <a href=\"872.html\"> <dt><span>05</span><font>2025.12</font></dt> <dd> <h2>喜报｜中国移动中标三连！万里数据库彰显全域布局实力</h2> <font>2025.12.05</font> <p></p> </dd> </a> </dl> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>",
